Package: gx-shell
Version: @VERSION@
Section: shells
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: gx0404 <gx0404@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: librsvg2-common
Provides: herdr
Conflicts: herdr, herdr-gx, ohmyzsh-gx
Replaces: herdr-gx, ohmyzsh-gx
Homepage: https://github.com/gx0404/gx_shell
Description: Ghostty GX terminal, GX Zsh (Oh My Zsh GX) and herdr in one package
 GX Shell bundles the Ghostty GX terminal (an unofficial fork of Ghostty, not
 affiliated with or endorsed by the Ghostty project) with its themes
 and fonts, the isolated Oh My Zsh GX profile on a pinned Zsh runtime (gx-zsh),
 and the herdr terminal workspace manager. Ghostty GX is a GTK 4 application
 that needs Ubuntu 24.04 or later (GTK 4.14, libadwaita 1.5).
 User configuration is created only when an ordinary user runs a launcher;
 maintainer scripts never modify HOME, existing dotfiles or the login shell.
